pons\-trace \- Check an explicit ordered JSON event trace against a TOML protocol
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpons trace\fR <\fB\-\-protocol\fR> [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPATH\fR>
